<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AFTI Technical Guide: Beekeeping</title>
    <script src="afti-core.js?v=2"></script>
    <style>
        :root { --bg:#0f172a; --card:#1e293b; --txt:#f8fafc; --primary:#27ae60; --hud:#144d29; --accent:#eab308; }
        body { font-family:system-ui, sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--txt); padding:20px; display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; min-height:100vh; margin:0; }
        .container { width:100%; max-width:800px; background:var(--card); border-radius:14px; padding:35px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
        .hud-bar { background:var(--hud); border-radius:8px; padding:10px 18px; margin-bottom:25px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; font-weight:bold; font-size:0.9rem; }
        .task-label { background:#0f172a; padding:20px; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid #334155; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:15px; cursor:pointer; margin-bottom:12px; }
        .task-cb { margin-top:4px; transform:scale(1.3); accent-color:var(--primary); }
        .bridge-box { background:rgba(39,174,96,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(39,174,96,0.4); padding:25px; border-radius:12px; text-align:center; display:none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <div class="hud-bar" style="background:#582f0e; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);">
        <span>AFTI Technical Mastery Module</span>
        <button onclick="window.location.href='index.html'" style="background:#334155; color:#fff; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); padding:5px 12px; border-radius:6px; font-size:0.75rem; cursor:pointer;">🏠 Portal</button>
    </div>
    <div>
        <span style="background:rgba(234,179,8,0.15); color:var(--accent); font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; padding:4px 8px; border-radius:4px; display:inline-block; margin-bottom:10px;">Livestock &amp; Pollinator Tutorials</span>
        <h2 style="margin:0 0 0.5rem 0; font-size:1.4rem;">🐝 Beekeeping Essentials &amp; Hive Maintenance Checklist</h2>
        <p style="line-height:1.6; color:#cbd5e1; margin-bottom:25px;">Mastering seasonal hive population balances and organic pest mitigation metrics ensures optimal pollination scores. Complete the five baseline milestones below to log your portfolio scores.</p>
        
        <div style="margin-bottom:25px;">
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>1. Setup Langstroth Anatomy &amp; Queen Excluder Grids</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Stack brood boxes cleanly below honey supers, locking wire dividers to stop queen egg laying in harvest combs.</div></div></label>
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>2. Map Southeast Morning Sun Apiary Entry Flightpaths</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Face hive doors East to trigger fast morning forage flights while building 6-foot barriers near high-traffic paths.</div></div></label>
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>3. Perform Sugar Roll Varroa Mite Parasite Population Audits</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Monitor hive health by rolling worker samples in sugar to count mite fall rates per 100 bees.</div></div></label>
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>4. Execute Organic Acid Fumigation &amp; Health Mitigations</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Apply formic or oxalic acid treatments safely to kill parasites without leaving synthetic chemical residues in comb wax.</div></div></label>
            <label class="task-label"><input type="checkbox" class="task-cb" onchange="checkProg(this)"><div><strong>5. Enforce 18% Honey Moisture Threshold Extraction SOPs</strong><div style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.9rem;">Verify frames are fully capped and cured below 18% water volume before running uncapping scraper forks.</div></div></label>
        </div>
        <div id="bridge-panel" class="bridge-box">
            <h3 style="color:#4ade80; margin-top:0;">🎉 Module Complete: Beekeeping Operations Mastered!</h3>
            <p style="color:#cbd5e1; font-size:0.95rem; margin:0 0 15px 0;">Your entomology and apiary metrics have been compiled. Your portfolio tracking scores are updated.</p>
            <button onclick="window.print()" style="background:#334155; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 20px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2); border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer; margin-right:10px;">🖨️ Print Log</button>
            <button onclick="window.location.href='index.html'" style="background:var(--primary); color:#fff; font-weight:bold; padding:10px 20px; border:none; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer;">Return to Portal Home &rarr;</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script>
    function checkProg(cb) {
        if(window.awardGlobalXP) { window.awardGlobalXP(cb.checked ? 15 : -15); }
        const cbs = document.querySelectorAll('.task-cb'); const all = Array.from(cbs).every(c => c.checked);
        document.getElementById('bridge-panel').style.display = all ? 'block' : 'none';
    }
</script>
</body>
</html>
